exports.description:
Which zone the value falls in (the `<meter>` gauge region):
- optimum between low and high: [low, high] is optimum, either side suboptimal;
- optimum below low: below low is optimum, [low, high] suboptimal, above high critical;
- optimum above high: above high is optimum, [low, high] suboptimal, below low critical.

parts.description:
One character of the code. Renders an `<input>` (one per `length` of the root). Typing replaces the slot's character and
moves on; pasting or autofilling spreads a whole code from the slot; Backspace and Delete remove a character and step back;
the arrow keys, Home and End move between slots. Only the slot that holds the caret is in the tab order.

